<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-PLAYERS' CHAMPIONSHIP SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-PLAYERS' CHAMPIONSHIP SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading second</p>
<p>round scores in the Players' Championship golf tournament at the</p>
<p>par-71 Robina Woods course on Friday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>131 Justin Cooper 67 64</p>
<p>135 Bradley Hughes 70 65, J.J. West (U.S.) 65 70</p>
<p>138 Scott Laycock 67 71</p>
<p>139 Anthony Painter 70 69, Craig Spence 65 74</p>
<p>140 Choi Kyung-ju (South Korea) 74 66, Robert Stephens 74 66</p>
<p>141 Craig Kamps (South Africa) 73 68, Stephen Leaney 69 72</p>
<p>142 Glenn Joyner 73 69, Paul Devenport (New Zealand) 72 70,</p>
<p>Darren Cole 72 70, Darren Barnes 72 70, Jean-Louis Guepy</p>
<p>(France) 71 71, Michael Long (New Zealand) 71 71, Greg</p>
<p>Chalmers 71 71</p>
</text>
